WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 22]

01:39.080 --> 01:40.300
I'm willing

01:40.790 --> 01:42.460
to offer it up with both hands.

01:43.240 --> 01:44.570
A smooth talker.

01:45.430 --> 01:47.380
Clearly used to dealing in the mortal world

01:47.590 --> 01:48.890
and very street smart.

01:49.430 --> 01:50.700
Quite impressive.

01:58.800 --> 02:00.260
Didn't expect you to be this sensible.

02:01.000 --> 02:01.810
I am not one

02:02.230 --> 02:03.940
to take by force.

02:05.030 --> 02:07.170
Your Fire Control Technique may be minor,

02:07.670 --> 02:08.900
but it's rather interesting.

02:10.600 --> 02:12.180
I can offer some spells and pills

02:12.200 --> 02:13.090
in exchange.

02:13.960 --> 02:14.900
Think carefully.

02:15.640 --> 02:16.450
What do you want in return?

02:24.420 --> 02:25.500
[Fire Control Technique]

02:35.670 --> 02:36.900
Please, have some tea.

02:45.560 --> 02:47.330
If you're still pleased,

02:47.760 --> 02:49.260
then I'd like to ask,

02:49.950 --> 02:50.980
if I may,

02:51.230 --> 02:53.410
for a pill to help break through.

02:53.590 --> 02:55.380
I hope you'll grant this favor.

03:00.480 --> 03:01.820
I have two bottles of Yellow Dragon Pills.

03:02.760 --> 03:03.820
You know

03:04.480 --> 03:05.290
what they're good for.

03:06.710 --> 03:07.460
Take them.

03:13.710 --> 03:14.820
Are you sure

03:15.430 --> 03:17.050
you're not with those two?

03:17.350 --> 03:18.260
Those two?

03:19.310 --> 03:20.330
Who're you talking about?

03:27.280 --> 03:28.260
In any case,

03:30.200 --> 03:30.930
I do have

03:31.400 --> 03:32.540
one more favor to ask.

03:32.840 --> 03:33.980
If you can do it,

03:34.350 --> 03:35.410
our Spirit Beast Mountain

03:35.950 --> 03:37.330
will reward you handsomely.

03:41.590 --> 03:42.490
So, you're a senior

03:42.790 --> 03:44.980
from Spirit Beast Mountain!

03:45.750 --> 03:46.410
Senior,

03:46.560 --> 03:47.540
if you ask,

03:48.000 --> 03:48.850
how could I

03:49.240 --> 03:50.570
possibly refuse?

03:50.910 --> 03:51.660
However,

03:52.310 --> 03:53.410
I must admit,

03:53.470 --> 03:54.980
my skills are limited.

03:55.190 --> 03:56.850
I worry I may ruin your plans.

03:59.120 --> 04:00.570
It's nothing grand.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.890
It's something

04:06.080 --> 04:07.340
about your disciple, the Young Prince,

04:08.280 --> 04:09.730
and Steward Wang.

04:10.520 --> 04:11.610
I suspect

04:11.800 --> 04:13.340
they're colluding with the demonic sects.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.820
Will you keep an eye on them for me?

04:19.150 --> 04:20.170
Are you willing?

04:26.680 --> 04:28.500
This is a fine warding artifact.

04:29.150 --> 04:29.890
Hold on to it.

04:30.310 --> 04:31.100
If the task is done,

04:31.590 --> 04:32.380
there'll be more rewards.

04:33.120 --> 04:34.100
Rest assured,

04:34.870 --> 04:36.690
I won't let you down.

04:37.220 --> 04:39.260
[Violet Pearl]

04:40.400 --> 04:42.410
As long as this blood curse's still on us,

04:42.960 --> 04:44.780
we're stuck working for them.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.100
Talking won't help.

04:47.240 --> 04:49.010
We might as well catch a few more rogues!

04:50.150 --> 04:50.690
Catch?

04:51.000 --> 04:52.500
You think we're catching rats here?

04:52.710 --> 04:54.660
He wanted three today, maybe five tomorrow.

04:55.000 --> 04:56.220
Most of the lone rogue cultivators

04:56.360 --> 04:57.820
have already scattered!

04:58.560 --> 04:59.500
At this rate,

05:00.240 --> 05:00.980
Er,

05:01.400 --> 05:03.540
why don't you throw us in with them too?

05:03.800 --> 05:04.540
Am I wrong?

05:04.710 --> 05:05.450
Si!

05:05.630 --> 05:06.610
Say that again!

05:06.750 --> 05:07.610
Go on, say that again!

05:07.630 --> 05:09.010
Am I wrong, huh?

05:09.190 --> 05:10.820
Don't listen to his nonsense.

05:11.080 --> 05:12.220
What happened to San

05:12.560 --> 05:13.850
hurts all of us.

05:15.470 --> 05:16.980
I want to write a letter

05:17.630 --> 05:19.500
to that immortal from Clear Void Sect.

05:19.800 --> 05:21.260
If they're willing to help,

05:21.310 --> 05:22.380
maybe this whole thing...

05:22.630 --> 05:23.260
The Seven Sects?

05:24.030 --> 05:24.820
Da,

05:25.680 --> 05:27.940
they're busy fighting the demonic sects.

05:28.470 --> 05:29.850
Even in peacetime,

05:30.000 --> 05:31.850
have they ever cared about rogue cultivators like us?

05:40.400 --> 05:42.100
No matter what, I will save San.

05:42.590 --> 05:43.570
Even if you won't,

05:43.910 --> 05:44.890
I will have to go alone!

05:50.750 --> 05:51.340
Er!

05:56.390 --> 05:57.020
Da.

05:58.480 --> 05:59.100
We

05:59.240 --> 06:01.100
grew up with San...

06:07.870 --> 06:09.660
There's no way we're leaving her behind!

06:10.160 --> 06:11.340
But now's not the time.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.580
And I won't let you go alone!

06:20.600 --> 06:21.220
Da.

06:22.360 --> 06:23.410
If you ask me,

06:24.270 --> 06:26.460
the Seven Sects are losing ground fast.

06:26.630 --> 06:27.700
They can barely take care of themselves.

06:28.190 --> 06:29.290
We might as well

06:29.630 --> 06:30.580
join the Black Fiend Cult.

06:31.630 --> 06:32.540
Safer that way.

06:38.560 --> 06:39.610
She's just a mortal.

06:40.160 --> 06:40.610
Yeah,

06:40.800 --> 06:41.540
a mortal.

06:41.870 --> 06:42.660
What's the problem?

06:44.310 --> 06:45.540
I may be young,

06:46.000 --> 06:47.540
but I'm not a clueless kid!

06:47.800 --> 06:48.810
If you want to fool someone,

06:49.040 --> 06:50.810
at least don't use a mortal to brush me off.

06:51.750 --> 06:53.020
Sure, you're a cultivator.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.410
But right now,

06:54.720 --> 06:56.290
you're only at the Tier 5 of Qi Refining.

06:56.950 --> 06:58.140
In front of me,

06:58.480 --> 06:59.900
or those villains,

07:00.160 --> 07:01.100
you're not much different from a mortal.

07:01.800 --> 07:03.100
So why look down on them?

07:05.120 --> 07:05.730
Anyway,

07:06.310 --> 07:07.610
your personal life has nothing to do with me.

07:08.390 --> 07:09.020
If you want to go,

07:09.240 --> 07:10.220
I won't stop you.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.340
Miss Mo here is an old friend of mine.

07:18.600 --> 07:20.290
She has some ties to Steward Wang at the estate.

07:20.830 --> 07:21.700
She's been investigating

07:21.870 --> 07:23.370
in secret for a long time.

07:31.630 --> 07:32.700
Don't underestimate her.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.900
She's tougher than she looks.

07:41.610 --> 07:42.980
Your Fragrance Pellets are great.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.290
I even brought my sister to buy some.

07:44.750 --> 07:45.490
Thanks!

07:45.510 --> 07:47.020
Next time, I'll give you both a bigger discount.

07:47.190 --> 07:47.810
Sounds great.

07:52.460 --> 07:53.120
[Snow-Petal Skincare]

07:53.120 --> 07:55.410
Snow-Petal Skincare...

08:01.870 --> 08:02.580
Li.

08:02.950 --> 08:03.610
Miss Mo.

08:04.000 --> 08:04.900
Your clinic

08:05.160 --> 08:06.170
is really something.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.580
How are you

08:23.000 --> 08:24.290
selling more cosmetics than medicine?

08:24.600 --> 08:25.540
Li,

08:25.920 --> 08:27.540
don't tease me.

08:27.750 --> 08:30.100
It's all because of the Fragrance Pellet

08:30.240 --> 08:31.100
you taught me to make.

08:31.510 --> 08:33.900
The ladies in the capital love it.

08:34.270 --> 08:36.580
They're always begging me to make more.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.170
One thing led to another,

08:40.310 --> 08:42.100
and now the clinic barely feels like a clinic anymore.

08:42.750 --> 08:43.490
Still,

08:44.070 --> 08:45.340
it's opened some doors

08:45.600 --> 08:47.980
for gathering information.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.140
Li, please.

08:59.190 --> 09:00.050
I know your personality.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.370
Dealing with those people

09:02.950 --> 09:03.810
must be tough for you.

09:06.240 --> 09:07.100
From now

09:07.430 --> 09:08.580
until this is all over,

09:08.950 --> 09:09.580
Miss Mo,

09:09.830 --> 09:11.410
you must stay away from Steward Wang.

09:12.510 --> 09:14.050
Quickly erase any signs

09:14.510 --> 09:15.700
of your prior investigations.

09:17.630 --> 09:18.980
Don't worry, Li.

09:19.360 --> 09:20.980
I know what's at stake.

09:21.120 --> 09:22.340
This time,

09:23.310 --> 09:25.980
I'm just trying to track down the missing cultivators.

09:26.680 --> 09:28.610
I won't attempt to assassinate him again.

09:35.040 --> 09:37.170
Lately, several supply runs

09:37.190 --> 09:39.050
have gone through different estates

09:39.240 --> 09:40.580
under Steward Wang's command.

09:41.190 --> 09:42.340
Although

09:43.000 --> 09:44.490
they've been careful,

09:44.750 --> 09:46.410
keeping things spread out.

09:47.070 --> 09:48.200
I have a few reliable contacts

09:48.200 --> 09:49.540
in and out of the estate.

09:50.160 --> 09:51.580
Piecing together

09:52.830 --> 09:54.170
what I've learned,

09:54.750 --> 09:55.850
I suspect

09:56.310 --> 09:57.730
those missing cultivators

09:58.000 --> 09:59.850
are being held in a few specific places.

10:00.270 --> 10:01.700
Give me a moment, Li.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.370
Li, look.

10:18.270 --> 10:19.420
This is the east side of the city,

10:19.720 --> 10:21.370
too crowded with shops and people.

10:21.600 --> 10:22.850
Not a good place to keep anyone.

10:24.240 --> 10:25.340
The west side's near the palace,

10:25.630 --> 10:26.370
with guards all over.

10:26.870 --> 10:27.730
Hard to move there.

10:28.120 --> 10:28.770
Not ideal either.

10:29.000 --> 10:29.700
It should be...

10:30.960 --> 10:31.700
This spot!

10:32.150 --> 10:33.700
We should check out all these places.

10:34.790 --> 10:35.940
Aren't you quite smart?

10:36.150 --> 10:37.490
Come on, let's hear your thoughts.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.060
Earlier,

10:39.200 --> 10:40.460
that Li fellow went missing

10:40.480 --> 10:42.890
near a base in the south of the city.

10:43.270 --> 10:44.530
And Miss Zhao too.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.770
They both vanished on the way back

10:47.000 --> 10:47.940
through the South Gate.

10:48.240 --> 10:48.730
So I think

10:48.910 --> 10:49.940
every one of these spots

10:50.080 --> 10:50.730
needs checking!

10:52.030 --> 10:53.460
You really know a lot

10:53.630 --> 10:54.890
for someone so young.

10:55.150 --> 10:56.250
You're amazing.

10:58.510 --> 10:59.580
Someone's right too.

10:59.840 --> 11:01.580
You're a pretty sharp lady.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.370
Miss Cui'er,

11:06.080 --> 11:07.340
let's talk inside.

11:07.630 --> 11:08.180
Come.

11:09.030 --> 11:09.610
Let's go.

11:14.630 --> 11:15.820
Those two hit it off.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.460
No need to worry there.

11:30.480 --> 11:31.700
I once dreamed

11:32.240 --> 11:33.580
of running a clinic like this.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.730
The simple life of a mortal

11:38.150 --> 11:39.300
isn't so bad.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.220
Li,

11:47.080 --> 11:48.370
here's the rouge you asked for.

11:49.480 --> 11:50.220
Thanks.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.530
How much silver?

11:51.840 --> 11:52.820
I'll have Qin Gui send it over.

11:53.630 --> 11:55.010
Come on, don't be so formal.

11:56.030 --> 11:57.010
We're friends, aren't we?

11:58.840 --> 11:59.650
Still,

12:00.720 --> 12:03.060
this is women's stuff.

12:03.670 --> 12:04.490
Is it

12:04.550 --> 12:06.220
for that Miss Xuan'er we saw last time?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.180
You've got it wrong, Miss Mo.

12:11.790 --> 12:13.850
It's for a senior sister of mine.

12:14.030 --> 12:15.220
She's really into this kind of thing.

12:20.600 --> 12:22.530
Senior Zhong's gotten me in trouble!

12:23.150 --> 12:25.060
I'm never shopping for her again.

12:29.910 --> 12:31.100
Li,

12:31.870 --> 12:33.610
you sure have

12:34.510 --> 12:35.730
a lot of senior and junior sisters.

12:56.200 --> 12:57.180
Come look!

12:57.440 --> 12:58.850
This herb is so pretty!

13:03.840 --> 13:04.940
She's got talent,

13:05.150 --> 13:06.370
but she's still too naïve.

13:07.240 --> 13:07.980
If no one guides her,

13:08.240 --> 13:09.220
I worry

13:10.120 --> 13:11.250
she'll get herself into trouble.

13:12.440 --> 13:13.770
I still need to do some digging.

13:14.670 --> 13:15.420
Cui'er

13:16.910 --> 13:18.650
may need you to look after.

13:19.510 --> 13:20.180
Sure.

13:27.720 --> 13:28.730
Li,

13:31.270 --> 13:32.490
I know

13:33.080 --> 13:34.180
what you're really thinking.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.370
You said I should look after her,

13:37.120 --> 13:38.060
but in truth,

13:39.030 --> 13:40.490
you want her to protect me, right?

13:45.360 --> 13:46.370
Don't worry.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.460
I can take care of myself.

13:51.080 --> 13:51.890
And of course,

13:52.270 --> 13:53.580
I'll keep an eye on Cui'er too.

13:54.150 --> 13:55.420
I'll make sure she doesn't get in your way.

14:02.910 --> 14:03.700
Here,

14:04.240 --> 14:04.980
take this talisman.

14:05.670 --> 14:06.370
Keep it on you.

14:06.910 --> 14:07.850
If you're in danger,

14:08.080 --> 14:08.980
it'll trigger on its own

14:09.510 --> 14:10.180
to save your life.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.700
Hopefully,

14:14.440 --> 14:15.420
you'll never need it.

14:16.120 --> 14:16.730
Time to go.

14:20.320 --> 14:21.220
Li!

14:31.080 --> 14:32.340
Will I see you again?

14:41.750 --> 14:42.650
He's gone?

14:46.240 --> 14:47.180
Thank goodness!

14:53.510 --> 14:54.650
On the seventh day of the seventh month,

14:55.080 --> 14:55.890
a unit of a hundred men

14:56.150 --> 14:57.420
from Saber-Shearing Sect

14:58.150 --> 14:59.340
was ambushed

14:59.550 --> 15:00.530
at Yanliang Mountain.

15:01.510 --> 15:02.820
More than half were killed or wounded.

15:03.120 --> 15:04.100
After years of fighting,

15:04.440 --> 15:05.980
is there not any good news?

15:10.200 --> 15:10.820
Wan.

15:11.360 --> 15:12.060
Nichang?

15:12.720 --> 15:14.420
Weren't you headed to Tiandu Kingdom for reinforcements?

15:14.840 --> 15:15.700
Why are you here?

15:16.150 --> 15:17.530
Did something major happen at the front?

15:17.960 --> 15:18.730
It's good news.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.100
A victory report just came in.

15:20.550 --> 15:22.420
Spirit Beast Mountain and Skyfort Castle won a big battle.

15:23.120 --> 15:24.130
Elder Han led the charge

15:24.630 --> 15:25.770
and managed to trap

15:25.840 --> 15:27.340
over a hundred Foundation cultivators from Beast Taming Sect.

15:28.000 --> 15:28.850
They even killed

15:29.030 --> 15:30.370
two Core Formation demonic cultivators.

15:30.840 --> 15:31.770
But,

15:32.600 --> 15:33.820
didn't our people

15:34.360 --> 15:35.370
find out before

15:35.790 --> 15:36.770
that Elder Han

15:37.000 --> 15:38.580
was in close contact with the demonic sects,

15:38.840 --> 15:40.220
even exchanging letters?

15:40.790 --> 15:41.730
Is the report reliable?

15:43.000 --> 15:43.980
There was contact, sure,

15:45.000 --> 15:46.770
but it was all part of Elder Han's ruse.

15:47.320 --> 15:48.700
She pretended to defect to gain their trust.

15:49.630 --> 15:50.460
If we hadn't already learned

15:50.510 --> 15:52.130
Beast Taming Sect's route,

15:52.840 --> 15:53.940
this surprise attack

15:54.200 --> 15:55.100
wouldn't have worked.

15:56.670 --> 15:58.180
Still, something feels off.

15:59.240 --> 15:59.980
If Spirit Beast Mountain

16:00.150 --> 16:01.530
can fool the demonic sects,

16:02.150 --> 16:03.010
what's stopping them

16:03.030 --> 16:04.300
from fooling us too?

16:05.240 --> 16:05.980
Wan,

16:06.200 --> 16:07.580
it's good to be cautious.

16:08.750 --> 16:09.490
But this victory

16:09.750 --> 16:10.650
is real.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.700
Many disciples saw it firsthand.

16:13.750 --> 16:14.980
Some Core Formation cultivators

16:15.720 --> 16:16.890
even fell in the battle.

16:18.150 --> 16:19.180
Even if the demonic sects

16:19.510 --> 16:21.130
and Spirit Beast Mountain were colluding,

16:21.790 --> 16:22.650
they wouldn't throw away

16:22.870 --> 16:24.010
Core Formation cultivators' lives

16:24.240 --> 16:25.130
just to keep up appearances.

16:33.790 --> 16:35.490
This is a much-needed win

16:37.120 --> 16:39.420
after all those bitter fights

16:39.600 --> 16:41.100
against the demonic scum!

16:42.750 --> 16:43.490
Not bad at all!

16:44.960 --> 16:46.370
Once the dust settles,

16:46.670 --> 16:49.490
I'll go learn from Elder Han.

16:51.270 --> 16:52.130
These past days,

16:52.270 --> 16:53.250
I've been feeling low.

16:53.480 --> 16:54.420
You've been shouldering

16:54.870 --> 16:56.060
the burden of battle command.

16:57.630 --> 16:58.460
It's my fault

16:59.080 --> 17:00.770
for dragging down the Golden Drum Plains campaign.

17:05.870 --> 17:06.610
Hongfu,

17:07.270 --> 17:08.650
still no word on Xuan'er?

17:09.440 --> 17:10.890
That demon keeps moving around.

17:11.390 --> 17:12.770
We have no idea

17:12.790 --> 17:13.890
where he's hiding her.

17:14.320 --> 17:14.980
No matter.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.490
Clear Void Sect and Spirit Beast Mountain

17:17.960 --> 17:19.300
will meet up with us in a few days.

17:19.720 --> 17:20.940
Once the main forces gather,

17:21.440 --> 17:22.700
I'll send more people

17:23.000 --> 17:24.220
to expand the search.

17:24.840 --> 17:25.770
We'll find her for sure!

17:34.550 --> 17:35.940
Wang Chan of Ghost Spirit Sect

17:36.670 --> 17:38.250
seeks an audience with Grandmaster Yunlu!

17:38.790 --> 17:40.010
Please announce him!

17:40.110 --> 17:41.730
You brat's here.

17:42.380 --> 17:43.010
What now?

17:43.240 --> 17:44.580
Come begging for medicine?

17:45.390 --> 17:46.940
So young

17:47.320 --> 17:48.420
and already sick?

17:49.240 --> 17:51.130
Or is it for your father?

17:51.630 --> 17:53.060
You jest, Grandmaster.

17:53.870 --> 17:55.610
I recently came across a rare item,

17:56.600 --> 17:57.220
and thought

17:57.440 --> 17:58.890
it might be of interest to you.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.700
So I made a special trip to present it!

18:02.360 --> 18:03.420
A rare item?

18:04.630 --> 18:05.890
Let's see it.

18:06.870 --> 18:07.700
Please, Grandmaster.

18:08.840 --> 18:09.610
Take a look!

18:20.720 --> 18:21.850
Wang Chan of Ghost Spirit Sect

18:22.080 --> 18:23.490
greets Grandmaster Yunlu!

18:59.160 --> 19:00.420
Unbelievable...

19:00.420 --> 19:04.020
[Grandmaster Yunlu]

19:04.030 --> 19:05.050
How's your mother?

19:06.240 --> 19:07.290
Is she doing well?

19:14.720 --> 19:15.660
My mother...?

19:27.550 --> 19:28.620
Time flies.

19:28.870 --> 19:30.140
You've grown so much already.

19:31.860 --> 19:33.200
What's your name?

19:34.760 --> 19:36.200
I'm Dong Xuan'er.

19:37.790 --> 19:39.510
Still so stubborn.

19:42.920 --> 19:43.460
My master

19:43.750 --> 19:45.010
is supposed to be righteous!

19:45.160 --> 19:46.660
How would she side with you demonic lot?

19:46.920 --> 19:47.660
Righteous?

19:48.310 --> 19:49.140
Demonic?

19:49.550 --> 19:52.050
Who filled your head with such outdated nonsense?

19:52.550 --> 19:53.940
The so-called Seven Sects

19:54.480 --> 19:56.490
were all born from the Six Demonic Sects.

19:57.550 --> 19:58.810
A few centuries ago,

19:59.920 --> 20:02.620
the Righteous Alliance and the Grassland Clans invaded.

20:03.000 --> 20:04.250
They took advantage of the chaos

20:04.590 --> 20:06.050
and broke away.

20:06.790 --> 20:08.330
They act all high and mighty,

20:09.510 --> 20:11.010
but they're just a bunch

20:11.550 --> 20:13.330
of self-righteous fame chasers.

20:14.830 --> 20:16.050
I've never heard

20:16.480 --> 20:17.770
any of that before.

20:21.030 --> 20:21.900
Someone like Grandmaster Yunlu

20:22.510 --> 20:23.330
has no reason

20:24.960 --> 20:26.250
to lie to you.

20:27.880 --> 20:30.180
Moonshadow Sect came from Joyful Union Sect.

20:31.720 --> 20:32.620
Spirit Beast Mountain

20:32.750 --> 20:34.380
was born of Beast Taming Sect.

20:35.160 --> 20:35.770
And now,

20:36.030 --> 20:36.810
even Yan Clan Stronghold

20:37.160 --> 20:38.460
has returned to Ghost Spirit Sect.

20:39.070 --> 20:39.980
The Seven Sects

20:42.350 --> 20:43.620
are already on the verge of collapse.

20:45.440 --> 20:46.220
Is that so?

20:55.480 --> 20:56.330
Maybe it's time

20:57.880 --> 20:59.330
your father here

21:00.110 --> 21:02.620
gave you a real education.

21:04.400 --> 21:05.250
Father?

21:06.440 --> 21:08.140
A tiger's cub

21:09.790 --> 21:11.940
should never live among sheep.

21:16.590 --> 21:17.420
Xuan'er,

21:18.880 --> 21:20.250
from this day on,

21:20.640 --> 21:22.810
you are my direct disciple.

21:24.110 --> 21:25.420
You are no longer allowed

21:25.960 --> 21:28.900
to practice anything from Yellow Maple Valley.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.770
With your gift of enchantment,

21:32.480 --> 21:35.460
you should cultivate the ultimate art of Joyful Union Sect.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.090
I told you,

21:42.590 --> 21:44.660
you owe me a thanks.

21:45.830 --> 21:47.490
Now go on, acknowledge your kin,

21:47.720 --> 21:48.570
and call him Master.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.730
So this man is really my father?

22:05.880 --> 22:07.490
I never knew.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.380
Congrats, Grandmaster!

22:23.000 --> 22:23.700
Today,

22:24.310 --> 22:26.420
you're finally reunited with your dear Xuan'er.

22:26.920 --> 22:29.090
I won't forget this great favor

22:29.350 --> 22:30.770
from Ghost Spirit Sect.

22:32.830 --> 22:33.810
But tell me,

22:34.440 --> 22:36.220
how did you and Xuan'er meet?

22:37.240 --> 22:38.980
When you brought her here,

22:39.440 --> 22:41.140
didn't her mother stop you?

22:41.350 --> 22:42.530
My mother...

22:43.350 --> 22:45.050
Could it be Master Hongfu?

22:45.790 --> 22:46.460
Is she

22:46.830 --> 22:48.290
really my mother?

22:51.590 --> 22:52.460
Reporting,

22:53.240 --> 22:54.460
Xuan'er and I first met

22:54.510 --> 22:55.980
at Yan Clan Stronghold.

22:56.640 --> 22:58.220
Even back then, I could tell

22:58.350 --> 22:59.660
she carried a powerful legacy.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.140
Honestly, Yellow Maple Valley

23:03.590 --> 23:05.810
is rotten from top to bottom.

23:06.440 --> 23:07.660
They even had male and female disciples

23:07.880 --> 23:08.940
train together.

23:09.030 --> 23:11.090
They clearly wanted them to pair off.

23:13.110 --> 23:14.530
I've seen Xuan'er

23:14.640 --> 23:16.250
blushing like crazy.

23:17.030 --> 23:18.620
You'd better be careful,

23:18.920 --> 23:21.290
or some sleazy guy may trick you,

23:21.830 --> 23:22.940
and mess with your cultivation.

23:25.640 --> 23:26.660
That's enough nonsense!

23:28.750 --> 23:30.050
Is that true?

23:34.070 --> 23:35.380
What's that guy's name?

23:37.680 --> 23:38.810
Just some nobody,

23:39.160 --> 23:39.770
not worth mentioning.

23:40.590 --> 23:41.250
He's Li Feiyu.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.530
Of course,

23:43.830 --> 23:44.490
if you

23:44.960 --> 23:46.250
hadn't asked,

23:47.030 --> 23:47.980
that name

23:48.160 --> 23:50.490
wouldn't be worth speaking in your presence.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.290
You're the one not worthy!

23:52.480 --> 23:53.530
I am!

23:54.860 --> 23:59.060
[A few days later]

24:12.240 --> 24:13.860
This ancient book isn't ordinary.

24:14.790 --> 24:16.940
Too bad I only understand the intro, some Aura Concealment Technique.

24:17.510 --> 24:19.090
The rest is hard to decipher.

24:19.960 --> 24:20.770
I'll find someone

24:20.960 --> 24:22.050
to translate it later.

24:39.000 --> 24:39.900
It's been days now,

24:40.510 --> 24:41.460
and still no sign.

24:44.680 --> 24:46.620
I can't sense Wu Sanxing's spirit at all.

24:48.000 --> 24:48.730
Maybe...

24:49.440 --> 24:50.380
he's been killed?

25:04.550 --> 25:05.420
Come on, let's go!

25:05.440 --> 25:06.080
That's enough!

25:06.270 --> 25:06.770
Move!

25:07.070 --> 25:07.570
Move, Wu!

25:07.590 --> 25:08.140
Let's go!

25:26.680 --> 25:27.570
Poor Wu.

25:28.310 --> 25:29.250
They got him in the end.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.460
But those guys who buried him

25:31.790 --> 25:32.730
look so familiar.

25:32.920 --> 25:33.380
Da,

25:33.590 --> 25:34.460
are they gone?

25:34.640 --> 25:35.570
- Yeah, they're gone. - So it really was them.

25:35.590 --> 25:36.900
That's just despicable.

25:36.930 --> 25:37.570
Wait.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.090
Where are you all headed?

25:40.310 --> 25:42.050
Shall I send you off myself?

25:47.640 --> 25:48.380
Who's that?

25:49.200 --> 25:49.940
Who are you?

25:50.270 --> 25:51.220
Say your name!

25:51.310 --> 25:52.380
Hiding your face like that,

25:52.550 --> 25:53.870
what kind of coward are you?

25:53.870 --> 25:54.380
Yeah!

25:54.380 --> 25:54.910
Hang us longer,

25:54.910 --> 25:56.090
and our heads are going to burst!

25:56.370 --> 25:57.380
The gang of us

25:57.640 --> 25:59.730
doesn't ask to be born the same day!

25:59.880 --> 26:01.980
Only to die the same day!

26:02.640 --> 26:03.490
If you want to kill us,

26:03.680 --> 26:04.730
make it quick!

26:04.750 --> 26:05.810
Yeah, make it quick.

26:05.880 --> 26:06.420
Ow!

26:07.640 --> 26:08.530
Weren't there five of you?

26:09.400 --> 26:10.220
Where's the last one?

26:11.000 --> 26:11.940
How'd he know that?

26:12.830 --> 26:13.980
Are we famous now?

26:14.110 --> 26:15.220
Our name's finally out there!

26:16.720 --> 26:17.380
Where's the last one?

26:17.960 --> 26:18.490
San?

26:18.590 --> 26:19.980
She's been taken.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.700
San's been kidnapped.

26:33.640 --> 26:34.220
Da!

26:46.110 --> 26:47.050
That's a Wind Barrier spell.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.420
You won't break through.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.330
Da, he's over there!

26:53.110 --> 26:54.180
Spill everything you know.

26:54.830 --> 26:56.050
Right now.

26:59.110 --> 26:59.730
No?

27:01.680 --> 27:02.700
Then rot in there.

27:04.510 --> 27:05.730
- Please! - Senior!

27:05.960 --> 27:06.980
- Please, Senior! - Senior!

27:07.200 --> 27:08.330
We're just victims too!

27:08.350 --> 27:09.010
Yeah, we're the pitiful ones!

27:09.160 --> 27:10.220
We were cursed

27:10.480 --> 27:11.290
and bound by a spell!

27:11.480 --> 27:12.090
We...

27:12.160 --> 27:13.010
Who cursed you?

27:13.440 --> 27:13.940
Black...

27:14.200 --> 27:14.900
Black Fiend Cult!

27:15.510 --> 27:16.010
Why?

27:16.640 --> 27:17.810
They controlled us.

27:18.350 --> 27:19.250
They made us help them

27:19.640 --> 27:20.620
lure and capture rogue cultivators

27:20.720 --> 27:22.290
around Yue Kingdom.

27:23.240 --> 27:23.940
Where are those rogue cultivators now?

27:24.200 --> 27:25.140
The rogues...

27:26.160 --> 27:26.900
We don't know.

27:31.720 --> 27:32.570
So basically,

27:33.590 --> 27:34.900
you've all got blood

27:35.720 --> 27:36.860
on your hands.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.420
Blood?

27:38.720 --> 27:39.940
We'd never dare kill cultivators!

27:39.960 --> 27:41.220
- Yeah! - We kept our hands clean!

27:42.240 --> 27:43.660
Then who killed the ones you buried?

27:44.400 --> 27:45.570
It... it wasn't us!

27:45.750 --> 27:47.810
Steward Wang of Prince Xin's Mansion told us to bury them!

27:48.030 --> 27:48.860
And the others?

27:48.880 --> 27:49.620
I'm telling you,

27:49.750 --> 27:50.530
those cultivators

27:50.640 --> 27:51.900
weren't killed.

27:52.310 --> 27:53.140
The Black Fiend Cult

27:53.160 --> 27:54.140
just hid them away somewhere!

27:55.310 --> 27:56.010
Where are they hidden?

27:56.310 --> 27:56.770
They're hidden at...

27:57.110 --> 27:57.730
at...

27:57.960 --> 27:58.570
at...

27:58.750 --> 27:59.860
We really don't know.

28:05.310 --> 28:06.050
Senior!

28:06.070 --> 28:06.860
We do know!

28:07.400 --> 28:09.090
- We know! We'll take you there! - Senior!

28:09.240 --> 28:10.980
Are you with the Seven Sects?

28:12.240 --> 28:13.570
Seven Sects?

28:18.790 --> 28:19.490
Senior,

28:19.920 --> 28:21.180
I once met Elder Liu

28:21.480 --> 28:22.490
from your side.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.050
He's our second uncle.

28:24.110 --> 28:25.230
- No, our eldest uncle. - Yeah, eldest.

28:25.230 --> 28:26.180
Eldest or second, uncle's still uncle.

28:26.200 --> 28:26.560
Right.

28:32.510 --> 28:33.090
Senior,

28:34.030 --> 28:34.730
please help us

28:34.960 --> 28:35.730
break the blood curse

28:35.920 --> 28:36.900
and lift the restriction spell.

28:37.830 --> 28:39.010
We swear to aid you

28:39.720 --> 28:40.620
in wiping out the Black Fiend Cult

28:41.000 --> 28:41.900
and restoring justice!

28:41.960 --> 28:42.860
Even if it costs us our lives!

28:42.920 --> 28:43.860
The Five Meng

28:44.070 --> 28:45.490
is known for our loyalty!

28:49.440 --> 28:51.250
The Five Meng? What a joke!

28:51.640 --> 28:52.420
They can't do anything right,

28:52.640 --> 28:53.420
only good at screwing things up!

28:55.830 --> 28:57.090
They're just outer disciples

28:57.350 --> 28:59.490
who never passed the sects' entrance trials.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.980
The Master already put a blood curse on them long ago.

29:07.550 --> 29:09.660
Good thing you were sharp enough.

29:11.240 --> 29:12.620
Now those losers

29:13.880 --> 29:15.290
won't be blabbing anymore.

29:16.200 --> 29:17.490
That Wu Sanxing guy

29:17.750 --> 29:19.420
clearly had backup.

29:22.030 --> 29:23.570
But that may not be a bad thing.

29:25.440 --> 29:26.770
The Master happens to need

29:27.030 --> 29:29.490
Foundation Establishment Stage blood for his cultivation.

29:29.830 --> 29:30.940
This guy

29:31.310 --> 29:33.180
may be just what he needs.

29:36.160 --> 29:37.770
If anyone else starts asking questions

29:38.270 --> 29:39.570
like Wu did,

29:40.440 --> 29:42.010
they're probably connected to him.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.090
We can capture them too

29:44.920 --> 29:46.180
and offer them to Master!

30:04.740 --> 30:07.380
[Ledger]

30:25.160 --> 30:25.660
San!

30:25.830 --> 30:26.290
San!

30:26.510 --> 30:27.140
San!

30:33.310 --> 30:33.940
San!

30:34.270 --> 30:35.250
- Da, Er. - San!

30:35.270 --> 30:36.330
You're finally back!

30:42.640 --> 30:43.530
Master,

30:43.920 --> 30:45.050
you lifted the spell on us

30:45.640 --> 30:46.980
and rescued our sister too.

30:47.550 --> 30:48.460
This is a debt

30:49.000 --> 30:49.860
we'll never forget!

30:51.310 --> 30:51.860
Enough.

30:52.200 --> 30:52.940
Get up, all of you.

30:54.350 --> 30:54.900
Get up.

30:56.880 --> 30:58.420
Since the five of you were forced into it,

30:59.000 --> 30:59.770
I won't report this

31:00.510 --> 31:01.860
to the sects.

31:03.310 --> 31:03.980
However,

31:04.160 --> 31:05.290
if you're truly turning over a new leaf,

31:05.550 --> 31:07.050
you'd better make up for what you've done.

31:07.510 --> 31:08.380
Master,

31:08.510 --> 31:09.810
whatever you need, just say the word!

31:10.350 --> 31:11.290
How many strongholds

31:11.480 --> 31:12.810
does the Black Fiend Cult have in this city?

31:13.270 --> 31:14.290
You have one day

31:14.790 --> 31:15.730
to find out and report back.

31:16.750 --> 31:17.530
Understood!

31:26.000 --> 31:26.570
Miss Mo.

31:29.680 --> 31:30.770
We're closed for the day.

31:31.000 --> 31:32.140
All of you, head home for now.

31:32.440 --> 31:33.460
Got it, Miss Mo.

31:40.780 --> 31:42.900
[Snow-Petal Skincare]

31:49.680 --> 31:51.570
These are the transport records.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.980
All supplies like food and weapons.

31:54.590 --> 31:55.940
Enough to support several dozen people.

31:56.790 --> 31:57.580
Looks like these places

31:57.580 --> 31:58.980
really are their bases.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.140
Quick!

32:46.160 --> 32:46.700
Let's go!

32:46.750 --> 32:47.290
Hurry!

32:47.680 --> 32:48.530
Move!

32:56.070 --> 32:57.620
Thank you, Master, for saving us!

32:57.830 --> 32:58.620
This way!

32:59.780 --> 33:00.700
Hurry!

33:01.720 --> 33:02.490
Cui'er!

33:02.640 --> 33:03.490
Grandpa!

33:03.720 --> 33:04.330
Cui'er!

33:09.960 --> 33:10.700
Thank goodness!

33:14.790 --> 33:16.860
A family should always stay together.

33:23.480 --> 33:24.980
Wu recognized him too.

33:29.110 --> 33:31.050
I recognized him at first glance.

33:31.960 --> 33:32.460
Wait,

33:32.590 --> 33:33.700
was that your secret signal?

33:34.000 --> 33:35.490
Remember the Tainan Bazaar?

33:39.750 --> 33:42.090
I'll trade two strengthening pills

33:45.000 --> 33:46.460
for your book.

33:47.680 --> 33:48.460
That's loyalty for you!

33:48.480 --> 33:49.730
Well then, farewell!

33:53.110 --> 33:54.220
Wait, I remember now.

33:54.350 --> 33:55.010
It was him!

33:55.480 --> 33:56.530
Yeah, it was him!

33:56.680 --> 33:57.330
That's right!

33:57.550 --> 33:59.700
Back at the Tainan Bazaar,

34:00.000 --> 34:01.330
he was just a rogue cultivator

34:01.400 --> 34:03.290
at Tier 7 or 8 of Qi Refining.

34:03.350 --> 34:04.010
Yeah.

34:04.400 --> 34:05.620
His cultivation was even lower than mine.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.940
But now he's so powerful!

34:08.550 --> 34:11.050
Who cares his past?

34:11.640 --> 34:12.530
Anyway,

34:12.790 --> 34:14.220
he's a Foundation Establishment cultivator now!

34:16.110 --> 34:17.420
He's an old acquaintance!

34:18.240 --> 34:19.460
I'll go say hi,

34:19.480 --> 34:20.090
and...

34:20.110 --> 34:20.940
Hey, what are you doing?

34:20.960 --> 34:21.980
Where are you going?

34:23.160 --> 34:24.770
He clearly doesn't want to be recognized.

34:24.830 --> 34:26.380
If he did, he would've said something.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.700
That's basic etiquette in the cultivation world.

34:28.830 --> 34:29.620
Do you get it?

35:08.440 --> 35:09.810
Let's lie in ambush!

35:09.920 --> 35:11.220
Let them fall into our trap!

35:13.030 --> 35:14.220
If we follow him,

35:14.440 --> 35:15.860
we're bound to catch the other one too.

35:18.920 --> 35:19.460
Wu!

35:35.440 --> 35:36.730
We've waited so long.

35:37.000 --> 35:37.860
Will he be back?

35:38.400 --> 35:39.250
Enough with the nonsense.

35:39.350 --> 35:39.980
Just wait!

35:44.070 --> 35:45.010
Master!

35:46.110 --> 35:47.130
Master!

35:47.280 --> 35:47.980
Where is he?

35:48.590 --> 35:49.820
It really is him!

35:54.440 --> 35:55.260
Master,

35:55.510 --> 35:56.170
these people

35:56.320 --> 35:56.940
are right here!

35:57.320 --> 35:58.460
Yeah, this is the place!

36:10.760 --> 36:12.460
Just a basic earth-element array.

36:12.760 --> 36:13.610
Nothing to worry about.

36:14.070 --> 36:15.420
We can smash through it.

36:16.510 --> 36:17.490
But we're guests.

36:17.920 --> 36:18.820
Let's be polite.

36:19.880 --> 36:20.860
I'll knock first.

36:47.320 --> 36:48.010
Master,

36:48.110 --> 36:49.690
you think there may be an ambush?

37:20.880 --> 37:21.420
Well,

37:21.880 --> 37:23.130
you've finally shown yourselves.

37:23.300 --> 37:25.280
[Tie Luo]

37:25.280 --> 37:25.980
Sir,

37:26.510 --> 37:27.860
that's the one who raided

37:28.110 --> 37:29.300
our branch outpost!

37:36.400 --> 37:37.300
Take him alive!

37:38.150 --> 37:38.820
Form the array!

39:20.710 --> 39:22.010
A mid-Foundation cultivator?

39:23.230 --> 39:24.530
I'll need to go all out!

39:25.510 --> 39:26.940
Good luck, everyone!

40:15.230 --> 40:15.900
Wu!

40:16.590 --> 40:17.380
Wu!

40:17.840 --> 40:18.980
Wu!

40:19.440 --> 40:20.340
Wu!

40:20.550 --> 40:21.340
What's wrong?

40:21.360 --> 40:22.570
What's going on with Wu?

40:22.630 --> 40:23.570
Master!

40:23.590 --> 40:24.490
Wu is...

40:24.510 --> 40:25.170
She is...

40:26.970 --> 40:27.910
Hey...

40:28.440 --> 40:28.900
Oh.

40:30.320 --> 40:31.380
Charge!

40:49.710 --> 40:50.170
Wu!

40:50.280 --> 40:50.780
Wu!

40:52.960 --> 40:53.820
We can't stop her!

40:54.710 --> 40:55.210
I'll...

40:59.230 --> 41:00.210
What did you do?

41:00.840 --> 41:01.780
Someone stay and watch her.

41:07.710 --> 41:08.690
You're in trouble now!

41:09.760 --> 41:10.490
I...

41:12.110 --> 41:12.740
Wu!

41:53.800 --> 41:54.690
That hide is tough!

41:55.190 --> 41:56.050
Looks like

41:56.190 --> 41:57.090
we won't break through anytime soon.

42:13.190 --> 42:13.980
Wait!

42:15.480 --> 42:16.690
I'm Prince Xin's son!

42:17.360 --> 42:18.980
The Seven Sects made a pact.

42:19.670 --> 42:20.740
Cultivators aren't allowed

42:20.840 --> 42:22.650
to harm royal bloodlines!

42:23.550 --> 42:24.490
Their rules

42:25.070 --> 42:26.010
don't apply to me.

42:26.670 --> 42:28.210
If you're not one of the Seven Sects,

42:28.510 --> 42:30.210
then why get involved?

42:32.840 --> 42:33.690
Because I feel like it.

42:58.110 --> 42:58.650
Watch him.

42:58.880 --> 42:59.420
Don't kill him!

43:33.230 --> 43:34.900
Master!

43:35.630 --> 43:36.260
Master!

43:36.400 --> 43:37.490
It was the Black Fiend Cult

43:37.630 --> 43:38.740
who set you up!

43:38.960 --> 43:40.170
It was all them!

43:40.480 --> 43:42.170
I was forced into this!

43:42.510 --> 43:43.420
I've never had

43:43.670 --> 43:44.650
a personal grudge with you!

43:45.030 --> 43:45.780
If you let me go today,

43:45.880 --> 43:47.610
I'll reveal every secret I know

43:48.110 --> 43:49.860
about the Black Fiend Cult.

43:51.710 --> 43:52.940
I heard you're from Lanzhou.

43:53.150 --> 43:54.530
Do you know someone named Mo Juren?

43:57.960 --> 43:58.940
Master,

44:00.000 --> 44:01.460
what's your grudge with him?

44:03.920 --> 44:04.860
That man

44:05.230 --> 44:06.860
once tried to kill me

44:07.590 --> 44:08.490
and failed.

44:10.110 --> 44:11.340
So in a way,

44:12.230 --> 44:14.380
I helped you get revenge.

44:17.030 --> 44:18.380
I wiped out his entire clan.

44:23.360 --> 44:24.650
You're on the path to immortality,

44:25.190 --> 44:27.570
so why target a mortal family?

44:30.760 --> 44:31.940
Just a bunch of mortals.

44:32.280 --> 44:33.460
So what if they're dead?

44:34.030 --> 44:35.050
He dared to rival me once.

44:35.320 --> 44:36.460
That was enough.

44:39.400 --> 44:40.170
I was going to ask

44:40.230 --> 44:41.610
about your demonic transformation technique...

44:44.440 --> 44:45.130
Master,

44:45.840 --> 44:46.780
if you'll spare

44:47.150 --> 44:47.900
my life,

44:48.070 --> 44:49.300
I'll give you the technique

44:49.760 --> 44:51.260
willingly!

44:55.280 --> 44:56.210
Forget it.

45:02.840 --> 45:03.980
Scum like you

45:04.960 --> 45:06.130
should just die.

45:36.860 --> 45:42.180
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

45:43.420 --> 45:48.820
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

45:48.940 --> 45:52.140
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

45:52.380 --> 45:54.620
♪Old scenes rise again♪

45:55.020 --> 45:57.860
♪Too hard to forget♪

45:58.380 --> 46:02.340
♪Easier just to miss♪

46:03.180 --> 46:08.660
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

46:09.820 --> 46:15.100
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

46:15.700 --> 46:18.740
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

46:19.020 --> 46:21.140
♪Swept away by time♪

46:21.780 --> 46:24.420
♪Eyes once looked far♪

46:24.900 --> 46:28.860
♪Now lost in the shift♪

46:29.340 --> 46:32.180
♪Autumn winds stir♪

46:32.460 --> 46:34.380
♪Smoke curls once more♪

46:34.820 --> 46:37.260
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

46:37.580 --> 46:41.100
♪Returning to my eyes♪

46:41.660 --> 46:44.620
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

46:44.940 --> 46:47.860
♪Time lost its name♪

46:48.260 --> 46:51.100
♪Was it yesterday♪

46:51.500 --> 46:55.060
♪Or tomorrow?♪

46:55.420 --> 46:58.260
♪The world has changed♪

46:58.660 --> 47:00.500
♪Beyond recall♪

47:01.060 --> 47:02.780
♪Time will fade♪

47:03.180 --> 47:07.980
♪All the words ever spoken♪

47:08.660 --> 47:11.540
♪Only this longing remains♪

47:12.020 --> 47:17.300
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

47:18.420 --> 47:25.060
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

47:25.540 --> 47:35.260
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
